
<section class="rounded-[32px] border-2 border-orange-100 bg-gradient-to-b from-white via-orange-50/30 to-slate-50/60 px-6 py-12 text-center shadow-sm sm:px-10">
  <div class="mx-auto flex h-20 w-20 items-center justify-center rounded-[28px] border-2 border-orange-200 bg-orange-100 text-4xl shadow-sm">
    🔎
  </div>

  <% if @investigation_search.present? || @investigation_filter != "all" %>
    <h2 class="mt-6 text-2xl font-black text-slate-800 sm:text-3xl">
      No matching investigations
    </h2>

    <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-600">
      No investigations match the current search and status filters.
      Your records have not necessarily been deleted; they may simply be
      outside the current view.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-7">
      <%= link_to "Clear search and filters",
                  saved_admin_research_workspaces_path,
                  class: "inline-flex items-center rounded-2xl border-2 border-orange-300 bg-gradient-to-r from-orange-400 to-amber-400 px-6 py-3 text-base font-black text-white shadow-sm transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-md" %>
    </div>
  <% else %>
    <h2 class="mt-6 text-2xl font-black text-slate-800 sm:text-3xl">
      No saved investigations yet
    </h2>

    <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-600">
      This library displays saved investigations available to your current
      workspace scope. Start an investigation from a supported research
      entry point, then return here to review and continue your work.
    </p>

    <div class="mx-auto mt-8 grid max-w-4xl grid-cols-1 gap-4 text-left md:grid-cols-3">
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-orange-100 bg-white p-5">
        <p class="text-lg font-black text-orange-700">01 · Discover</p>
        <p class="mt-2 text-base leading-7 text-slate-600">
          Open an entity or another supported research entry point.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-sky-100 bg-white p-5">
        <p class="text-lg font-black text-sky-700">02 · Investigate</p>
        <p class="mt-2 text-base leading-7 text-slate-600">
          Use the application's research action to create a saved workspace.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-emerald-100 bg-white p-5">
        <p class="text-lg font-black text-emerald-700">03 · Return</p>
        <p class="mt-2 text-base leading-7 text-slate-600">
          Reopen the library to continue or review the saved work.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mx-auto mt-8 max-w-3xl rounded-2xl border border-amber-200 bg-amber-50 p-5 text-left">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-black text-amber-900">
        Administrator guidance
      </h3>
      <p class="mt-2 text-base leading-7 text-amber-900">
        If you expected records here, verify that the creation action saved
        the workspace, that the controller uses the correct owner or visitor
        scope, and that the workspace status is recognized by this dashboard.
      </p>
    </div>
  <% end %>
</section>